    old "March out"
    new "En marche"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "We are to form ranks and to head out of the city. Our path lies across {i}the Valley of Death{/i}."
    new "Nous devons former les rangs et sortir de la ville. Notre chemin traverse {i}la Vallée de la Mort{/i}."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Defeat the Demorai ambush"
    new "Vaincre l'embuscade des Demorai"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Just as we've been taught, the Demorai have set up a trap for us as we were navigating the Valley of Death. Time to put our training to the {i}real{/i} test."
    new "Comme on nous l'a appris, les Demorai nous ont tendu un piège alors que nous traversions la Vallée de la Mort. Il est temps de mettre notre entraînement à l'épreuve {i}réelle{/i}."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "March on"
    new "En avant"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "We have claimed victory in our first real battle against the Demorai. I do realize we'd likely be crushed if it wasn't for First Officer Borras at our side, but all the training sessions vanish compared to what {i}real combat{/i} feels like."
    new "Nous avons remporté la victoire lors de notre première vraie bataille contre les Demorai. Je me rends compte que nous aurions probablement été écrasés sans l'officier en second Borras à nos côtés, mais toutes les séances d'entraînement ne sont rien comparées à ce que l'on ressent lors d'un {i}véritable combat{/i}."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Defeat the scorpion monster!"
    new "Vaincre le monstre scorpion !"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "We have walked into a horrifying monster. A gigantic scorpion that seemed to have... somehow inhabited a woman's body? It had burned First Officer Borras with a single spit of acidic substance. We are not prepared..."
    new "Nous sommes tombés sur un monstre terrifiant. Un scorpion gigantesque qui semblait avoir... d'une manière ou d'une autre, pris possession du corps d'une femme ? Il a brûlé l'officier en second Borras d'un seul crachat de substance acide. Nous ne sommes pas préparés..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Get to the abandoned fort"
    new "Atteindre le fort abandonné"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "We are now past the Valley of Death. Word is, it is going to take us more than a week to get to our objective. Having seen what we had seen, I really want this to be over, {i}soon.{/i}"
    new "Nous sommes maintenant passés au-delà de la Vallée de la Mort. Il paraît qu'il nous faudra plus d'une semaine pour atteindre notre objectif. Ayant vu ce que nous avons vu, j'ai vraiment hâte que tout cela se termine, {i}bientôt.{/i}"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Stand guard as mages open the seal"
    new "Monter la garde pendant que les mages ouvrent le sceau"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "At the deep cave beneath the deserted fort, we have found what seems to be a magically-sealed door. Captain Duprey ordered some of our mages to unlock it. There's tension in the air. Something's off..."
    new "Dans la grotte profonde sous le fort déserté, nous avons trouvé ce qui semble être une porte scellée par magie. Le capitaine Duprey a ordonné à certains de nos mages de la déverrouiller. Il y a de la tension dans l'air. Quelque chose ne va pas..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Survive the Demorai onslaught"
    new "Survivre à l'assaut des Demorai"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "The moment we have breached the seal, the fort was attacked by Demorai forces. We must come out of this alive!"
    new "Au moment où nous avons brisé le sceau, le fort a été attaqué par les forces Demorai. Nous devons en sortir vivants !"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Examine the chamber"
    new "Examiner la chambre"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:4
    old "Me and Markus have survived the battle by locking ourselves inside the chamber the mages have unlocked. Duprey, Kiara, countless other scouts died before our very eyes. We must find a way out. What is that eerie sound? It sounds like a heartbeat, but a little off-tempo..."
    new "Markus et moi avons survécu à la bataille en nous enfermant dans la chambre que les mages ont déverrouillée. Duprey, Kiara, d'innombrables autres éclaireurs sont morts sous nos yeux. Nous devons trouver une sortie. Quel est ce bruit étrange ? On dirait un battement de cœur, mais un peu décalé..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:14
    old "The Dark Passenger"
    new "Le Passager Noir"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/qst_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:15
    old "Our training was interrupted by what Captain Duprey called a top-secret mission to accomplish. We are to retrieve a relic of sorts from a fort way down south. It doesn't really sound scary, but I've got a bad feeling about it. Most of us do."
    new "Notre entraînement a été interrompu par ce que le capitaine Duprey a appelé une mission top-secrète à accomplir. Nous devons récupérer une sorte de relique dans un fort tout au sud. Ça ne semble pas vraiment effrayant, mais j’ai un mauvais pressentiment à ce sujet. La plupart d’entre nous aussi."

